  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vision, Mission and Strategy of The National Council for Gender Equality 2022 - 2025 - Annual Work Programme 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: Gender Equality and Women&#xbf;s Empowerment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective(s)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1: Institutional development and organizational strengthening of the network&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2: Prevention of gender stereotype and sexism, violence against women and domestic violence&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3: Economic strengthening of women, with special focus on women from rural areas and social entrepreneurship&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4: Women, leadership and participation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;5: Gender equality and climate change&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;6: Women, peace and security&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
